# Copy to .env for local development. Set the same variables in the Cloudflare
# Pages project settings for production.
#
# Everything prefixed PUBLIC_ is embedded in the built HTML and is visible to
# anyone. That is fine for the values below — none of them are secrets. Never add
# an API key here: this site has no server, so there is nowhere for a secret to hide.

# Where the consultation form posts. Until this is set, the form renders in a
# clearly-marked unconfigured state and shows the fallback email address instead of
# silently discarding submissions.
#
# See the ops repo DECISIONS.md D-04 for the provider options and their tradeoffs.
# Example: https://forms.originslynk.com/consultation
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Shown as the fallback contact and in the footer.
PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=bryce@originslynk.com
